                                "text": "“Ahm—why don’t you go back with Dad and Uncle Eugene. I’ll be over in a jiffy…” Gabriel looks up at her confused, but then takes off for his old man.",
                                "translation": "“嗯——你为什么不和爸爸还有尤金叔叔一起回去呢。我马上就过去……”加布里埃尔困惑地抬头看着她，然后就朝他老爸走去。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2a9a3446-01e2-4d7d-b618-9b0a79fbb895",
                                "sense_id": "8b12e200-2664-3cac-86f1-b6aaa81b46a7",
                                "text": "“You dwarves really believe in that old hag?” The soldier continued without waiting for an answer. “Ahm… You are dwarfin, pretty miss? I mean, well, you dress dwarfin, but you don’t look it.”",
                                "translation": "“你们矮人真的相信那个老巫婆？”士兵不等她回答就继续说道，“嗯……你真的是矮人吗，美丽的小姐？我的意思是，嗯，你穿得像矮人，但看起来不像。”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5e5af71e-df7b-4dae-bb4a-84c6c5a59670",
